Inference Ledger

Copyright © Summon Software Labs

Inference Ledger is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for exact per-request accounting across GPU time, KV/tensor state, model residency, transfers, cache reuse, recomputation, retries, energy where observable, and inference cost.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Inference Ledger does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All telemetry is
written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

Inference Ledger accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on the
terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
